  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s divine sense asks the price of a group of starlight firefly Gu. When Star Lord Wan Xiang’s will asks how to address him, he says to call him Eight Arm Immortal and that he wants the entire group. He connects through his own blessed land with changed divine sense Gu and connecting heaven Gu, so the will treats him as a stranger rather than the former Fox Immortal. After hearing the market rate challenge, the will drops the joke price and addresses him as Sir Eight Arm Immortal. They settle at three immortal essence stones for one thousand two hundred starlight firefly Gu, and he later bargains for spring star rain and star shoot Gu stock.",
      "chapters": [
        667
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "gu_star_shoot_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration notes that Fang Yuan is now known as Eight Arm Immortal, so for the time being no one would connect the identity to Hu Immortal blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        672
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "market-cover",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He activates divine sense Gu, connects to treasure yellow heaven under the Eight Arm Immortal identity, and contacts a seller.",
      "chapters": [
        682
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alias-trades",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under that name he requests a Gu worm and its recipe, but no one answers.",
